[0.002, "o", "\u001b[4;35mGoal\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                                 \r\n\r\nAuthor and publish \u001b[1;36;40mcourses/it/blockchain-indexing-and-subgraphs/\u001b[0m (\"Blockchain Indexing and Subgraphs\") end to end by following                       \r\n\u001b[1;36;40mscripts/backfill/prompt.md\u001b[0m in full, with \u001b[1;36;40m{{DISCIPLINE}}\u001b[0m = \u001b[1;36;40mit\u001b[0m, \u001b[1;36;40m{{SLUG}}\u001b[0m = \u001b[1;36;40mblockchain-indexing-and-subgraphs\u001b[0m, \u001b[1;36;40m{{TITLE}}\u001b[0m = \u001b[1;36;40mBlockchain Indexing and \u001b[0m     \r\n\u001b[1;36;40mSubgraphs\u001b[0m, and \u001b[1;36;40m{{MODEL}}\u001b[0m = the exact model identifier your harness runs (never a generic engine label), passed as \u001b[1;36;40mmodel\u001b[0m on every \u001b[1;36;40msave\u001b[0m and \u001b[1;36;40menrich\u001b[0m     \r\ncall. The manifest is \u001b[1;36;40mplanned\u001b[0m; do not call \u001b[1;36;40mplan\u001b[0m.                                                                                                     \r\n\r\nDifferences from that prompt, because loopq "]
[0.000, "o", "drives this session:                                                                                     \r\n\r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0mloopq commits: write RESULT.md with status \u001b[1;36;40mdone\u001b[0m and commit \u001b[1;36;40mcourse: backfill it/blockchain-indexing-and-subgraphs\u001b[0m once the manifest reads          \r\n\u001b[1m   \u001b[0m\u001b[1;36;40mpublished\u001b[0m, instead of printing \u001b[1;36;40mBACKFILL_RESULT: PUBLISHED\u001b[0m.                                                                                        \r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0mA hard stop is status \u001b[1;36;40mblocked\u001b[0m, with the reason and the state the course reached. A post-publish \u001b[1;36;40mENRICH_FAILED\u001b[0m goes in the RESULT body; the        \r\n\u001b[1m   \u001b[0mfragment is still \u001b[1;36;40mdone\u001b[0m.                                                                                                                           \r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0mIf Notes carry review findings or a gate failure, the course may already be \u001b[1;36;40mpublished\u001b[0m on this branch: fix exactly what they name, in place,       \r\n\u001b["]
[0.000, "o", "1m   \u001b[0mkeeping it \u001b[1;36;40mpublished\u001b[0m and every flag decided.                                                                                                      \r\n\r\n\u001b[4;35mRead first\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                           \r\n\r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0mscripts/backfill/prompt.md                                                                                                                        \r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0m.agents/skills/create-course/SKILL.md and every file under its references/                                                                        \r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0mscripts/infographic/README.md                                                                                                                     \r\n\r\n\u001b[4;35mFiles\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                                \r\n\r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0mcourses/it/blockchain-ind"]
